    Compared with
    `storedQRCompactSequenceProductBudget_lt_one_of_diagDominant_finite_max_columnRhsBudget_le`,
    the vector hypotheses are stated before division by the column/RHS norms:
    each compact norm budget is at most `cCol * ‖A_k(:,j)‖₂` or
